          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: تذبذب",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تذبذب — tazabzub — \"indecision; wavering\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اگر آپ تذبذب میں ہیں تو کل بتائیے۔ agar āp tazabzub meṅ haiṅ to kal batāiye. If you can't decide, let me know tomorrow."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تذبذب (tazabzub) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic tadhabdhub, \"dangling to and fro\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
